const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"同一篇研究也可能使用不同股本分母",en:"Share-count definitions differ even within one study"},body:{zh:"附录中的规模变量使用收盘价乘以A股总股数，而盈利价格比和账面市值比的市值分母使用总股数。两种股本范围并不总是相同。先写清分母，再讨论变量之间的关系，不能因为都叫市值就用一个字段覆盖全部定义。",en:"Size uses the closing price times total A-shares, while the market-value denominator for earnings-to-price and book-to-market uses total shares. These scopes need not coincide. Define the denominator explicitly rather than applying one market-cap field to every variable."},reference:{url:"https://finance.wharton.upenn.edu/~stambaug/size_value_china_appendix_2_rev.pdf",label:{zh:"作者在线附录 · Appendix B.1",en:"Author-hosted online appendix · Appendix B.1"}}},{title:{zh:"盈利口径包含非经常性项目处理",en:"The earnings measure treats nonrecurring items explicitly"},body:{zh:"附录优先使用扣除非经常性损益后的净利润，并在数据字典中说明该字段缺失时的替代处理。这个选择会影响盈利价格比与公司排序。复用时应保留原字段是否缺失和替代来源，不能只留下一个最终盈利数字。",en:"The appendix prioritizes profit excluding nonrecurring gains and losses and documents a fallback when that item is missing. This affects earnings-to-price and firm rankings. Preserve the missing-item flag and substitute source rather than retaining only the final earnings value."},reference:{url:"https://finance.wharton.upenn.edu/~stambaug/size_value_china_appendix_2_rev.pdf",label:{zh:"作者在线附录 · Appendix B.1; B.2",en:"Author-hosted online appendix · Appendix B.1; B.2"}}},{title:{zh:"账面权益先对齐合并范围",en:"Align the scope of book equity"},body:{zh:"账面市值比使用不含少数股东权益的股东权益，附录同时列出报告期和公告日期字段。报告期告诉我们会计量属于何时，公告日才帮助判断外部可得性。编辑建议区分两者，不把期末报表视为期末当天已经公开。",en:"Book-to-market uses shareholders' equity excluding minority interests. The dictionary also lists reporting periods and announcement dates. The former dates the accounting measure; the latter helps establish availability. Editorial application: do not assume quarter-end figures were public at quarter end."},reference:{url:"https://finance.wharton.upenn.edu/~stambaug/size_value_china_appendix_2_rev.pdf",label:{zh:"作者在线附录 · Appendix B.1; B.2",en:"Author-hosted online appendix · Appendix B.1; B.2"}}},{title:{zh:"波动率与最大单日收益不同",en:"Volatility differs from the largest daily return"},body:{zh:"作者把过去20个交易日收益的标准差与同一窗口的最大单日收益分别作为变量。它们一个衡量分散程度，一个记录极端正收益，不能互换。编辑建议在交易日历上构造窗口，并说明缺失、停牌和收益复权的处理。",en:"The appendix distinguishes the standard deviation of returns over 20 trading days from the maximum daily return in that window. Dispersion and an extreme positive observation are different measures. Editorial application: specify the trading calendar, missing days, suspensions and adjustment convention."},reference:{url:"https://finance.wharton.upenn.edu/~stambaug/size_value_china_appendix_2_rev.pdf",label:{zh:"作者在线附录 · Appendix B.1",en:"Author-hosted online appendix · Appendix B.1"}}},{title:{zh:"异常换手率还需要长期基准",en:"Abnormal turnover needs a longer-run baseline"},body:{zh:"附录将日换手率定义为成交量相对股数的比例，并用短期20日均值与较长期250日均值比较。短期均值、长期均值和二者的比值各有含义。不能直接拿成交额增速替代，也不能省去股本口径与成交量单位的核对。",en:"Daily turnover relates volume to shares, and the abnormal measure compares a 20-day average with a 250-day average. The short average, baseline and ratio are separate objects. Turnover-value growth is not a substitute; share scope and volume units must also match."},reference:{url:"https://finance.wharton.upenn.edu/~stambaug/size_value_china_appendix_2_rev.pdf",label:{zh:"作者在线附录 · Appendix B.1",en:"Author-hosted online appendix · Appendix B.1"}}},{title:{zh:"相似字段名不证明跨供应商等价",en:"Similar field names do not establish provider equivalence"},body:{zh:"数据字典特别区分WIND终端取得的含分红再投资、已处理拆股收益，与底层数据库中的另一收益字段。这个差异说明供应商内部也可能存在口径变化。关联教程只帮助准备复权与时点对齐，不能声称已复现作者的完整输入。",en:"The dictionary distinguishes terminal returns adjusted for splits and dividend reinvestment from a database return item not adjusted for splits. Even one provider may expose different definitions. The linked tutorials prepare price adjustment and as-of alignment, not the author's complete input dataset."},reference:{url:"https://finance.wharton.upenn.edu/~stambaug/size_value_china_appendix_2_rev.pdf",label:{zh:"作者在线附录 · Appendix B.2 · pp. 5–6",en:"Author-hosted online appendix · Appendix B.2 · pp. 5–6"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本篇聚焦作者附录的变量构造，不代替正文关于中国规模与价值效应的实证论证。WIND字段与当前平台字段不能直接等同，复权和披露时点仍需独立核对。",en:"This guide focuses on variable construction in the author's appendix, not the main article's empirical explanation of size and value in China. WIND items are not automatically equivalent to platform fields; adjustment and disclosure timing require separate checks."}};export{e as default};
